# The front door of Weft Cloud: Caddy gets and renews the certificates itself (Let's Encrypt) - the DNS entry of the address has to point to this server first.
# No access log on purpose (docs/server.md, "Datenschutz"): what is not written down cannot be handed out.
{$CLOUD_HOST:cloud.townwork.eu} {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy cloud:8080
}

